{%- comment -%}
  ============================================================
  COLLECTION LIST — exploração editorial de coleções
  ============================================================

  O QUE FAZ:
  Galeria de coleções curadas pelo lojista. Não é uma grade de cards
  iguais: um painel de introdução (eyebrow, título, texto, CTA) ocupa
  a primeira coluna e as coleções seguem como imagens verticais altas,
  com nome, micro descrição e seta. É o momento de IDENTIFICAÇÃO da
  narrativa da home — "escolha seu lado".

  ONDE É USADA:
  Home (templates/index.json) e qualquer página via preset.

  PRINCIPAIS PARTES:
  - Painel de intro (settings da seção), opcional: sem título nem
    texto ele some e as imagens ocupam a largura toda.
  - blocks 'featured_collection': cada um escolhe 1 coleção e pode
    sobrescrever imagem, título e descrição. Sem override, usa os
    dados reais da coleção (featured_image, title, description).
  - A imagem é o card: o texto fica sobre ela, no rodapé.

  INTERAÇÃO (desktop):
  Hover aumenta a imagem em ~2% e clareia o véu da foto; as outras
  coleções perdem um pouco de presença. Tudo por opacity/transform —
  sem 3D, sem glow, sem parallax.

  OBSERVAÇÕES:
  - As imagens são recortadas em retrato (3:4) via aspect-ratio, para
    a fileira ter ritmo mesmo com fotos de proporções diferentes.
  - O corpo do card recebe .scheme-dark: ele fica sobre a fotografia
    escura, mesmo a seção sendo clara, então precisa dos tokens de
    texto do esquema escuro.
  - Cantos retos de propósito: imagem editorial não é card.
  - Sem imagem na coleção, entra o placeholder do Shopify.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign has_intro = false
  if section.settings.heading != blank or section.settings.text != blank
    assign has_intro = true
  endif
-%}
<div
  class="collection-list {% if has_intro %}collection-list--with-intro{% endif %}"
  data-section-id="{{ section.id }}"
>
  <div class="collection-list__inner page-width">
    {%- if has_intro -%}
      <div class="collection-list__intro" data-reveal>
        {%- if section.settings.eyebrow != blank -%}
          <p class="eyebrow">{{ section.settings.eyebrow | escape }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if section.settings.heading != blank -%}
          <h2 class="collection-list__heading">{{ section.settings.heading | newline_to_br }}</h2>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if section.settings.text != blank -%}
          <p class="collection-list__text">{{ section.settings.text | escape }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if section.settings.button_label != blank -%}
          <a href="{{ section.settings.button_link | default: routes.collections_url }}" class="arrow-link collection-list__cta">
            {{ section.settings.button_label | escape }}
            {% render 'icon', name: 'arrow-right' %}
          </a>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    <ul class="collection-list__grid" role="list" data-collection-gallery>
      {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
        {%- liquid
          assign collection = collections[block.settings.collection]
          assign card_image = block.settings.image | default: collection.featured_image
          assign card_title = block.settings.title | default: collection.title
          assign card_text = block.settings.text
        -%}
        <li class="collection-list__item" data-reveal {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
          <a href="{{ collection.url | default: routes.collections_url }}" class="collection-card">
            <div class="collection-card__media">
              {%- if card_image != blank -%}
                {{
                  card_image
                  | image_url: width: 900
                  | image_tag:
                    loading: 'lazy',
                    class: 'collection-card__image',
                    widths: '300, 450, 600, 900',
                    sizes: '(min-width: 1000px) 22vw, 70vw',
                    alt: card_image.alt | default: card_title | escape
                }}
              {%- else -%}
                {{ 'collection-1' | placeholder_svg_tag: 'collection-card__image placeholder-svg' }}
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>

            <div class="collection-card__body scheme-dark">
              <h3 class="collection-card__title">
                {{ card_title | default: 'onboarding.collection_title' | t }}
              </h3>
              {%- if card_text != blank -%}
                <p class="collection-card__text">{{ card_text | escape }}</p>
              {%- endif -%}
              <span class="collection-card__arrow" aria-hidden="true">{% render 'icon', name: 'arrow-right' %}</span>
            </div>
          </a>
        </li>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .collection-list {
    padding-top: var(--space-section);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-section);
    background-color: var(--color-background);
  }
  .collection-list__inner {
    display: grid;
    gap: clamp(28px, 4vw, 56px);
    align-items: center;
  }
  /* Com intro: painel de texto + galeria. Sem intro: só a galeria. */
  .collection-list--with-intro .collection-list__inner {
    grid-template-columns: minmax(200px, 0.55fr) 3fr;
  }

  .collection-list__intro { max-width: 22rem; }
  .collection-list__intro .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .collection-list__heading { font-size: var(--f6); margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .collection-list__text { font-size: var(--f1); color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .collection-list__cta { color: var(--color-text-primary); }

  .collection-list__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 4px;
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .collection-card {
    position: relative;
    display: block;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: opacity 320ms ease;
  }
  .collection-card__media { position: relative; aspect-ratio: 3 / 4; overflow: hidden; background-color: var(--color-surface); }
  .collection-card__image {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
    transition: transform 700ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
  }
  /* Véu só na base, onde o texto encosta */
  .collection-card__media::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: var(--photo-veil-bottom);
    transition: opacity 320ms ease;
  }

  .collection-card__body {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    z-index: 2;
    padding: clamp(16px, 2vw, 28px);
  }
  .collection-card__title {
    font-family: var(--font-display-family);
    font-size: var(--f4);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-heading);
    line-height: var(--leading-heading);
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }
  .collection-card__text {
    font-family: var(--font-ui-family);
    font-size: var(--f0);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .collection-card__arrow {
    display: inline-flex;
    margin-top: 14px;
    color: var(--color-accent-readable);
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateX(-6px);
    transition: opacity 280ms ease, transform 280ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
  }
  .collection-card__arrow svg { width: 16px; height: 16px; }

  @media (hover: hover) {
    /* A coleção sob o cursor ganha presença; as irmãs recuam. */
    [data-collection-gallery]:hover .collection-card { opacity: 0.72; }
    [data-collection-gallery] .collection-card:hover,
    [data-collection-gallery] .collection-card:focus-visible { opacity: 1; }
    .collection-card:hover .collection-card__image,
    .collection-card:focus-visible .collection-card__image { transform: scale(1.02); }
    .collection-card:hover .collection-card__media::after { opacity: 0.75; }
    .collection-card:hover .collection-card__arrow,
    .collection-card:focus-visible .collection-card__arrow { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
  }
  /* No toque não existe hover: a seta fica sempre visível */
  @media (hover: none) {
    .collection-card__arrow { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 1000px) {
    .collection-list--with-intro .collection-list__inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .collection-list__intro { max-width: 100%; }
    /* Scroll horizontal com snap: mantém o formato retrato no mobile */
    .collection-list__grid {
      grid-auto-flow: column;
      grid-auto-columns: 68%;
      grid-template-columns: none;
      overflow-x: auto;
      scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-inline: calc(var(--page-gutter) * -1);
      padding-inline: var(--page-gutter);
      scrollbar-width: none;
    }
    .collection-list__grid::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
    .collection-list__item { scroll-snap-align: start; }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .collection-card,
    .collection-card__image,
    .collection-card__arrow,
    .collection-card__media::after { transition-duration: 0.01ms !important; }
    .collection-card:hover .collection-card__image { transform: none; }
  }
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:sections.collection_list.name",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "t:sections.collection_list.settings.eyebrow.label" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "heading", "default": "Collections", "label": "t:sections.collection_list.settings.heading.label" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "text", "label": "t:sections.collection_list.settings.text.label" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "button_label", "label": "t:sections.collection_list.settings.button_label.label" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "button_link", "label": "t:sections.collection_list.settings.button_link.label" }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "featured_collection",
      "name": "t:sections.collection_list.blocks.featured_collection.name",
      "settings": [
        { "type": "collection", "id": "collection", "label": "t:sections.collection_list.blocks.featured_collection.settings.collection.label" },
        { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image", "label": "t:sections.collection_list.blocks.featured_collection.settings.image.label", "info": "t:sections.collection_list.blocks.featured_collection.settings.image.info" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "title", "label": "t:sections.collection_list.blocks.featured_collection.settings.title.label", "info": "t:sections.collection_list.blocks.featured_collection.settings.title.info" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "text", "label": "t:sections.collection_list.blocks.featured_collection.settings.text.label" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "t:sections.collection_list.name",
      "blocks": [
        { "type": "featured_collection" },
        { "type": "featured_collection" },
        { "type": "featured_collection" },
        { "type": "featured_collection" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
